<title>POLAND: BORYSZEW SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.86 MLN.</title>
<headline>BORYSZEW SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.86 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.86 vs   1.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.14 vs   2.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.48 vs   1.95</p>
<p> Sales		   13.17 vs  12.70</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.46 vs   4.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.82 vs   7.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.98 vs   8.47</p>
<p> Sales		   68.81 vs  72.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical company is ZCHiTS</p>
<p>Boryszew SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
